{
  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation in a multiprofile RNA-only setup (pca_n2000 encoding) to assess its impact compared to avgpool aggregation (config_002). Validation accuracy (0.519) and F1 (0.4797) are lower than config_002, suggesting transformer aggregation may not improve performance in this context. The exact contribution of aggregation method versus other design factors remains uncertain without direct comparisons to alternative techniques."
}

